<title>INDIA: India Bombay exchange says trade delayed.</title>
<headline>India Bombay exchange says trade delayed.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) on Friday said trading at the exchange had been delayed due to a technical problem. Trading is expected to start at 10.30 a.m, the exchange said.</p>
</text>
